<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch January consumer spending rises 4.4 pct yr/y.</title>
<headline>Dutch January consumer spending rises 4.4 pct yr/y.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch consumer spending rose 4.4 percent in volume terms in January compared with January 1996, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.</p>
</text>
